  "conclusion": "Within the recovered fresh-target conversion path and the declared modern profile, the learning hook does not require a caller-supplied history snapshot: both target learning flags remain their constructor false values before the hook. The aligned source LearnedFlag PP string must not be used as the target model history.",
  "limitations": [
    "Static source proof only; original GUI execution and physical acceptance are not claimed.",
    "A retained or previously edited target model is outside this lifecycle. Its LearnedFlagOriginal cannot be inferred from raw PP strings.",
    "The lexical firmware predicate and concrete target VMT selection are essential; this receipt does not admit other firmware or classes.",
    "The fresh-target conclusion excludes an intervening caller edit or earlier target ProgrammingParameters hydration."
